{'symbol': 'AMP', 'date': '2023-03-09 09:20:00', 'title': "AM BEST ASSIGNS ISSUE CREDIT RATING TO AMERIPRISE FINANCIAL, INC.'S NEW SENIOR UNSECURED NOTES", 'text': 'OLDWICK, N.J.--(BUSINESS WIRE)-- #INSURANCE--AM BEST HAS ASSIGNED A LONG-TERM ISSUE CREDIT RATING OF “A-” (EXCELLENT) TO THE RECENTLY ANNOUNCED $750 MILLION, 5.15% 10-YEAR SENIOR UNSECURED NOTES, DUE MAY 15, 2033, ISSUED BY AMERIPRISE FINANCIAL, INC. (AMERIPRISE FINANCIAL) (HEADQUARTERED IN MINNEAPOLIS, MN) [NYSE: AMP]. THE OUTLOOK ASSIGNED TO THE CREDIT RATING (RATING) IS STABLE. ALL OTHER RATINGS OF AMERIPRISE FINANCIAL AND ITS SUBSIDIARIES ARE UNCHANGED.'}